LICENCE TO BE CHOSEN

The licence for the code in this repository has not been chosen yet (Pedro Beltrao to decide).
Until a licence is added here, all rights are reserved by the authors.

Notes for the decision:
- Parts of the pipeline (jurkat/yc/) and of the viewer (jurkat/viewer/app/) are derived from the yeast whole-cell
  viewer by Gudmundur Magnusson (github.com/zoidpuff/yeast_cell_viewer), which has no licence file. Agree a licence
  and the attribution with its author before publishing.
- The viewer bundles Mol* (MIT) at build time.
- The model data (Hugging Face dataset) derive from CC BY 4.0 sources (OpenOrganelle, AlphaFold DB, UniProt,
  STRING) and others; see README.md, "Data sources and licences". A data licence such as CC BY 4.0 would keep the
  attribution chain.
